# MPTC constraint with 'each' keyword — tests multi-class constraint syntax
# Tests that bind: validation works for MPTC constraints and that
# [each Comparable Showable] correctly applies both constraints.
#
# NOTE: Full MPTC validation with $Addable requires Addable class registration in class_env.
# That case will need a separate test when Addable class registration is added.
[
  multi-constrained: [fn@[bind: [a] constraint: [a: [each Comparable Showable]] return: a]
    [let x@a] x]
  result: [multi-constrained 42]
]

---

%.result
=== out
Int(42)
